[36m(TaskRunner pid=101285)[0m Now let’s rewrite this:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=101285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=101285)[0m 9b + 7 = k(b + 7) \Rightarrow 9b + 7 = kb + 7k
[36m(TaskRunner pid=101285)[0m $$
